      HCL Parser Update upstream 1.2.0 (#7239)
      
      Automated grammar update for hcl. Pin: 67a5c197 →
      [fad99186](https://github.com/MichaHoffmann/tree-sitter-hcl/tree/fad991865fee927dd1de5e172fb3f08ac674d914)
      (v1.2.0)
      
      **hcl**
      
      - Terraform target parsing now supports namespaced function calls such
      as provider::local::fn(...).
      - Terraform parsing now represents conditional and loop template
      directives with their conditions, binders, and bodies.
      - Terraform parsing now binds attribute and index traversal more tightly
      than unary operators.
      
      Parser and CST files are regenerated; vendored grammar sources are
      copied from the selected upstream revisions.
      
      Test plan:
      
      - Grammar corpus and standalone CST checks.
      - Eight focused Terraform tests pass; 393/394 language-tag tests pass.
      
